@startuml
title C15 adaptive shell branding and about dialog
' Traces: OMCT-C15-L2-05.01, OMCT-C15-L2-05.02, OMCT-C15-L2-05.03, OMCT-C15-L2-05.04
actor Operator
participant "DeviceClassifierService" as DeviceClassifier
participant "ThemeService" as ThemeService
participant "BrandingService" as BrandingService
participant "HttpBrandingGateway" as BrandingGateway
participant "Cupola.Api BrandingController" as BrandingController
participant "AppLogoComponent" as AppLogo
participant "OverlayService" as OverlayService
participant "AboutDialogComponent" as AboutDialog

DeviceClassifier -> DeviceClassifier: detect device, orientation, and touch characteristics
DeviceClassifier -> DeviceClassifier: add matching body classes
ThemeService -> ThemeService: remove existing theme link
ThemeService -> ThemeService: append selected theme CSS link

AppLogo -> BrandingService: getBranding()
activate BrandingService
BrandingService -> BrandingGateway: GET branding
activate BrandingGateway
BrandingGateway -> BrandingController: GET /api/branding
activate BrandingController
BrandingController --> BrandingGateway: branding options
deactivate BrandingController
BrandingGateway --> BrandingService: branding options
deactivate BrandingGateway
BrandingService --> AppLogo: logo and about options
deactivate BrandingService
AppLogo --> Operator: display configured logo

Operator -> AppLogo: activate logo
activate AppLogo
AppLogo -> BrandingService: getBuildInfo()
activate BrandingService
BrandingService -> BrandingGateway: GET build info
activate BrandingGateway
BrandingGateway -> BrandingController: GET /api/branding/build-info
activate BrandingController
BrandingController --> BrandingGateway: build information
deactivate BrandingController
BrandingGateway --> BrandingService: build information
deactivate BrandingGateway
BrandingService --> AppLogo: build information
deactivate BrandingService
AppLogo -> OverlayService: open large overlay
activate OverlayService
OverlayService -> AboutDialog: render branding, build, and license information
activate AboutDialog
AboutDialog --> OverlayService: dialog rendered
deactivate AboutDialog
OverlayService --> AppLogo: overlay displayed
deactivate OverlayService
AppLogo --> Operator: display about dialog
deactivate AppLogo
@enduml
